#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__effective_date
msgid "The date on which the withdrawal takes effect for the student."
msgstr "Tanggal berlakunya pengunduran diri bagi siswa."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__date
msgid "The date the withdrawal document was created."
msgstr "Tanggal dokumen pengunduran diri dibuat."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__reason_type
msgid ""
"The reason for this withdrawal. Determines the student's target state on "
"Done: Resignation maps to Resigned, while Drop Out and No News both map to "
"Dropped."
msgstr ""
"Alasan pengunduran diri ini. Menentukan status tujuan siswa saat Selesai: Pengunduran Diri dipetakan ke Mengundurkan Diri, sedangkan Putus Sekolah dan Tanpa Kabar sama-sama dipetakan ke Putus Sekolah / Dikeluarkan."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__student_id
msgid "The student being withdrawn from the school."
msgstr "Siswa yang mengundurkan diri dari sekolah."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__active_enrollment_id
msgid ""
"The student's currently active (open) enrollment. When set, its "
"academic_year_result is set to 'Drop Out' once this withdrawal reaches Done."
msgstr ""
"Pendaftaran siswa yang sedang aktif (terbuka). Bila terisi, academic_year_result-nya diatur menjadi 'Drop Out' setelah pengunduran diri ini mencapai status Selesai."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' untuk menghasilkan nomor secara otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk mengisi nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Pengisian nomor manual dapat dilakukan pada status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Mengisi Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat mengisi nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_student_withdrawal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_student_withdrawal.field_school_student_withdrawal__activity_exception_decoration
